      "en": "Always, night and day, in the tombs and in the mountains, he was crying out, and cutting himself with stones.",
      "ko": "밤낮 무덤 사이에서나 산에서나 늘 소리지르며 돌로 제 몸을 상하고 있었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "3dc6998afba97a652f6fe25aab54883aee4d4392887da3df24dbd6b470305492",
