      "en": "When he saw Jesus from afar, he ran and bowed down to him,",
      "ko": "그가 멀리서 예수를 보고 달려와 절하며",
      "source_text_hash": "5e8d2edc6c96d5b9e54f6bef8249341f66cf8960cb7a7c78a7c0243d7e2a9543",
      "translation_text_hash": "69bf88f521f863a8b832f70b9a51f34a7cf13cc2d3f64d68abf42b855f1f984c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
