      "en": "He asked him, “What is your name?”He said to him, “My name is Legion, for we are many.”",
      "ko": "이에 물으시되 네 이름이 무엇이냐 가로되 내 이름은 군대니 우리가 많음이니이다 하고",
      "source_text_hash": "2966e009f73d4ed9fe25df93a5e511afba09678b09eb836e70a3b36bc3769d86",
      "translation_text_hash": "36e1c230822a41dbca8fecf47fc9c4677f1b579cb86171a87bcf0885e58feaaa",
